                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Herbert.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram].</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-08-19"><hi rendition="#italic">August 19,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>You can see me any hour in the morning between 8 and 11.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
